      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    current_prices = [150, 152, 151, 153, 155]\n    prior_prices = [148, 149, 150, 151, 152]\n    period1 = 25\n    period2 = 13\n\n    # Calculate price changes and absolute price changes\n    price_changes = [\n        current - prior\n        for current, prior in zip(current_prices, prior_prices)\n    ]\n    absolute_price_changes = [abs(change) for change in price_changes]\n\n    def calculate_ema(values, period):\n        ema = [values[0]]\n        multiplier = 2 / (period + 1)\n\n        for value in values[1:]:\n            ema.append((value - ema[-1]) * multiplier + ema[-1])\n\n        return ema\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    pcs_ema = calculate_ema(price_changes, period1)\n    apc_ema = calculate_ema(absolute_price_changes, period1)\n\n    pcds_ema = calculate_ema(pcs_ema, period2)\n    apcds_ema = calculate_ema(apc_ema, period2)\n\n    tsi = (pcds_ema[-1] / apcds_ema[-1]) * 100\n\n    # return answer rounded to two decimal places\n    return round(tsi, 2)\n```",
